id=a32-jpeg-bbr
name=A32 JPEG + BBR fix
version=v2
versionCode=2
author=Najip, BBR and first JPEG workaround by Juan (LumiROM)
description=One UI 9 ports on the A32 4G: fixes blank JPEG photos (Telegram and others) by giving apps access to the kernel mtk_mm memory heap, and keeps TCP on BBR. Installed by the A325X kernel ZIP.
